{"text":"You⌃ mountains, that you⌃ skipped like rams, and you⌃ hills, like lambs?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"The earth trembled at the presence of the Lord, at the presence of the God of Jacob;","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"who turned the rock into pools of water, and the","poem":1},{"noteId":212},{"text":"flint into fountains of water.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":211,"caller":"+","text":"Or, consecrated thing.","reference":{"chapter":113,"verse":2}},{"noteId":212,"caller":"+","text":"Gr. sharp rock.","reference":{"chapter":113,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_lxx/PSA/113.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_lxx/PSA/114.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_lxx/PSA/112.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}